  "title": "Shredded Chicken Sandwiches with Pesto Mayonnaise",
  "description": "Moist shredded chicken, red peppers, and garlic join ripe tomatoes and pesto-flavored mayonnaise in these simple sandwiches that are perfect for lunch or a light dinner.",
  "authors": [
    "Jennifer Uhrlaub"
  ],
